SUMMARY:PMP Play for Paterson
DESCRIPTION:PMP Play for Paterson\nDecember 19\, 2026 at 1:00 p.m.\nPaterson School 16\, Paterson\nFREE Event \n \nFeaturing the Paterson Music Project’s small ensembles. Donations collected during this event will support the Paterson Healing Collective\, an organization that works with St. Joseph’s hospital to provide support and intervention for survivors of violence.
