DESCRIPTION:PMP Day of Jazz\nFebruary 27\, 2027 at 3:00 p.m.\nJohn F. Kennedy High School\, Paterson\nFREE Event \n \nPMP’s 4th annual Day of Jazz will feature music by the legendary Louis Armstrong in addition to other jazz greats. This event is supported by the Louis Armstrong Education Foundation.
