SUMMARY:NJYC Winter Concert
DESCRIPTION:NJYC Winter Concert\nJanuary 31\, 2027 at 4:00 p.m.\nRidge Performing Arts Center\n$20 Adults/$15 Students & Seniors\nClick HERE for tickets \nJoin the New Jersey Youth Chorus for our annual Winter Concert\, featuring all five NJYC ensembles. Choristers from across our program come together for an inspiring afternoon of music that showcases the artistry\, energy\, and joy of our vibrant choral community. \nNJYC Primo Coro: Melissa Hughes\, Director\nNJYC Cor Amici\, Camerata: Dan Malloy\, Director\nNJYC Sola Voce: Joanna Scarangello\, Director\nNJYC Coriste: Trish Joyce\, Director \nAccompanists: Christopher D’Amato\, Andrew Macirowski & Phillip Steffani
URL:https://whartonarts.org/calendar/njyc-winter-concert/
LOCATION:Ridge Performing Arts Center\, 268 South Finley Avenue\, Basking Ridge\, NJ\, 07920\, United States
CATEGORIES:NJYC,Wharton
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://whartonarts.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Anniversary-Photo.jpeg
END:VEVENT
