SUMMARY:NJYC 35th Anniversary: Home for the Holidays
DESCRIPTION:NJYC 35th Anniversary: Home for the Holidays\nDecember 6\, 2026 at 4:00 p.m.\nMorristown United Methodist Church\, Morristown\n$20 Adults/$15 Students & Seniors\nClick HERE for tickets \nNJYC’s Sola Voce and Coriste ensembles will be joined by alumni performers for a special Readings & Carols event celebrating the familiar warmth of coming home for the holidays. \nNJYC Sola Voce: Joanna Scarangello\, Director\nNJYC Coriste: Trish Joyce\, Director\nAccompanist: Phillip Steffani
