SUMMARY:Playathon Pops Concert
DESCRIPTION:Playathon Pops Concert\nMarch 7\, 2027\nThe Mills at Jersey Gardens Mall\, Elizabeth \nJoin us at the 2027 Playathon! This beloved annual tradition is our largest fundraiser. Come hear over 500 young musicians perform iconic cinematic scores and show tunes. Don’t miss out on this unforgettable pops concert. Alumni are invited to watch or perform!
URL:https://whartonarts.org/calendar/playathon-pops-concert/
LOCATION:The Mills at Jersey Gardens\, 651 Kapkowski Rd\, Elizabeth\, NJ\, 07201\, United States
CATEGORIES:NJYS,NJYS Alumni,Wharton
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://whartonarts.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/DSC_0128.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="NJYS":MAILTO:info@NJYS.org
END:VEVENT
